Z||000048||Smokin' GT||10-31-2001||02:11 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR><BR>(Snow...CA...get it?)<P>[/B]<HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>There's alot more snow than you think!  We do have the second highest mountain range in the U.S!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Disfourdan-87GT Good choice!  Tell them you're only young once, and all the rest of that stuff, especially about the lack of sex space.  Seriously, my parents bought me a station wagon for my first car and that thing (aside from some bad rug burns) was the ultimate sex mobile!  The fiero, my choice, unfortunately is completely sexually incompatible.  Believe me, I've tried!<P>------------------<BR>-87 Bright Blue Metallic GT-<BR>          -Joel||||reg||6
